  {
   "id": "p1_e0",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    91.0,
    70.4,
    866.0,
    130.4
   ],
   "text": "Eigenvalues and Eigenvectors"
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e1",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    91.0,
    181.4,
    1086.7,
    220.2
   ],
   "text": "A nonzero vector v is an eigenvector of a square matrix A if"
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e2",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    166.8,
    247.9,
    402.1,
    307.9
   ],
   "text": "A v = \u03bb v"
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e3",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    91.0,
    348.2,
    1201.6,
    387.0
   ],
   "text": "The scalar \u03bb is the eigenvalue: A only stretches v, it never turns it."
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e4",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    91.0,
    439.2,
    804.6,
    478.0
   ],
   "text": "To find \u03bb, solve the characteristic equation"
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e5",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    1243.7,
    444.6,
    1339.0,
    472.8
   ],
   "text": "Av = \u03bbv"
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e6",
   "kind": "drawing",
   "bbox": [
    1122.3,
    470.2,
    1289.2,
    637.0
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e7",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    166.8,
    505.7,
    557.1,
    565.7
   ],
   "text": "det(A \u2212 \u03bbI) = 0"
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e8",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    1198.2,
    569.0,
    1212.5,
    597.2
   ],
   "text": "v"
  },
  {
   "id": "p1_e9",
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox": [
    91.0,
    621.2,
    992.1,
    660.0
   ],
   "text": "Then each eigenvector lies in the null space of A \u2212 \u03bbI."
  }
 ]
}